type":"text"},{"text":"numbered in a dictionary as they are reached.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Returns the path’s states from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"start"},{"text":" to the goal, both included (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[start]"},{"text":" when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"start"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"satisfies ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"success"},{"text":", without calling ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors"},{"text":"), and its cost; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" when the reachable space","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is finite and holds no goal. On an infinite space with no reachable goal it does not return.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A goal is recognized when it is settled, so the distance is the shortest even when step costs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"depend on both ends of the step. Among equal-cost paths, which one is returned is unspecified.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inside an extension of ","type":"text"},{"code":"DirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the methods of the same name hide this function; call it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"code":"ShortestPaths.dijkstraShortestPath(from:cutoff:successors:success:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every examined cost is at least ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".zero"},{"text":" and not NaN (a cost is examined, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"checked, before the cutoff drops its step); ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cutoff"},{"text":" is not NaN; every sum fits in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoi